-- Fin-Comply Task Assessment seed: 56 templates.
-- One template per evidence signal of the rule knowledge base
-- (data/dpdp_kb), plus one GENERAL fallback template per rule. signal_field
-- records the rule field each template was written for: if a database holds
-- a different definition for that signal, the GENERAL template is used
-- instead of a mismatched task. Inactive rows are context-only signals and
-- never create a task on their own.
-- Run after db/create_task_templates.sql; safe to rerun. Applied
-- automatically by db/run_migrations.py.
